    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Paulo na Siraasi bali Teesalonika",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 17:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Paulo na Siraasi obu baamazire kuraba Anfiipoli na Apolooniya, baahika Teesalonika nambere Abayudaaya bakaba baina isorrokaniro. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.17.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.17.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 17:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Paulo yataahamu, yatandika kubaza nabo, engeso ye nkooku ekaba eri. Yamara wiiki isatu naabahakaniza naajurra Ebihandiiko ebirukwera, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.17.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.17.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 17:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "naasoborra kandi naagumya Kristo nkooku akaba ali w'okubonabonesibwa n'okuhumbuuka omu bafu, naagamba ati: “Yesu onu ou ndukubarangirra, nuwe Kristo.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.17.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.17.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 17:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abamu omuli bo baasikirizibwa ebi baahuliire, baayeteeraniza na Paulo na Siraasi. Kandi n'Abagiriiki baingi abaatiinaga Ruhanga bakeeteraniza nabo, hamu n'abakazi ab'ekitiinisa baingi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.17.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.17.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 17:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Baitu Abayudaaya baakwatwa ihali, nukwo kusorooza abasaija ababi abaikaraga nibenjeera, baimukiiriza ekitebe kikooto ky'abantu, baacwa epuumpu omu rubuga. Baataaha enju ya Yasooni, nibanihira kuturukya Paulo na Siraasi babahikye nambere abantu baayesoroliize. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.17.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.17.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 17:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Obu baababuzire, baacunda Yasooni n'abamu ha bagenzi baitu, baabahikya omumaiso g'abalemi b'orubuga nibatoka bati: “Abasaija bali abaajumikire ensi, baizire na hanu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.17.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.17.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 17:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yasooni nuwe abaraize; kandi banu boona nibakora ebintu ebirukuhakaniza ebiragiro bya Kaisaali, nibagira ngu, haroho omukama ondi arukwetwa Yesu.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.17.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.17.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 17:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abanyarubuga n'abalemi barwo obu baabihuliire, baatandika kutuntura. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.17.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.17.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 17:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yasooni na bagenzi be bakabanza kubaihaho omusimbo batakabalekiire.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.17.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.17.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Obulemeezi Paulo obu yatungire Beroya",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 17:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.17.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.17.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 17:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ekiro eki kyonyini ab'oruganda baacwisa Paulo na Siraasi, baakwata ogwa Beroya. Obu baahikireyo, baataaha omu isorrokaniro ly'Abayudaaya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.17.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.17.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 17:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abayudaaya baayo bakaba batali bantu abagumangana nk'aba Teesalonika. Bbo bakarahuka kwikiriza ekigambo kya Ruhanga n'omutima gumu, nibasoma buli kiro Ebihandiiko Ebirukwera, barole ebigambo binu obu biraaba biri by'amazima. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.17.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.17.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 17:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nahabweki Abayudaaya baingi omuli bo bakaikiriza, hamu n'abakazi Abagiriiki baingi, abantu b'ekitiinisa, oteho n'abasaija. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.17.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.17.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 17:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Baitu Abayudaaya ba Teesalonika obu baahuliire Paulo nkooku arangiriire ekigambo kya Ruhanga omu Beroya, nukwo kwijayo, baatamu abantu epuumpu, baabaimukiriza. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.17.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.17.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 17:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ahonaaho ab'oruganda baacwisa Paulo, atwarwe ogw'enyanja; baitu Siraasi na Timoteho baasigarayo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.17.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.17.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 17:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abo abaasendekeriize Paulo, bakamuhikya Ateena. Obu yamazire kubaha obukwenda obw'okugambira Siraasi na Timoteho barahuke bamusangeyo, bbo baakwata omuhanda, baagarukayo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.17.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.17.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Paulo ali Ateena",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 17:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.17.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.17.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 17:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Paulo obu akaba akyabategeriize Ateena, omutima gwamusarra muno habw'okurora orubuga oru rwijwire ebisisani by'abacwezi barwo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.17.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.17.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 17:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Buli kiro omu isorrokaniro yahakanizaaga Abayudaaya n'abanyamahanga abaatiinaga Ruhanga hamu na'bantu abandi aba yasangaga omu katale. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.17.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.17.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 17:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kandi abanyamagezi abamu ab'ekitebe ky'Omugiriiki Epikuliyo n'ab'ekitebe ekindi ky'entabiganya nabo baamuhakaniza. Abamu baakaguza bati: “Hati enjaaliimi egi neegamba ki?” Abandi baagarukamu bati: “Nasisana arukwegesa baruhanga aba tutamanyire” habwokuba akaba naayegesa hali Yesu na ha kuhumbuuka. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.17.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.17.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 17:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nukwo kumweta agende nabo, baamuhikya omu rukurato orurukwetwa Arehopago, baatandika kumukaguza bati: “Enyegesa enu empyaka, torukwija kutusoborra amakuru gaayo? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.17.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.17.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 17:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Habwokuba ebimu ebi otugambiire bituhuniriize. Nahabweki nitwenda kumanya amakuru gaabyo.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.17.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.17.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 17:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abantu boona b'Ateena n'abanyamahanga abakaba baliyo, bakaba bataina kindi eki baakoraga kwihaho kubaza n'okuhurra ebintu byona ebihyaka.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.17.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.17.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 17:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.17.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.17.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 17:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Paulo yayemerra omumaiso g'orukurato orwa Arehopago yatandika okubasoborra ati: “Inywe abasaija ba Ateena, mmazire kwetegereza nkooku muli bantu abarukutaho muno omutima ha diini mu buli kintu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.17.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.17.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 17:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "WIS.13.1"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Ama 13:1",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Habwokuba nambere nkarabire hoona, nsangire ebintu ebi murukuramya, kandi naasanga itambiro erimu erihandiikirweho liti: ‘Itambiro lya ruhanga atarukumanywa.’ Ningira ogu ou murukuramya mutamanyire, nuwe Ruhanga, nyowe ou ndukubarangirra.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.17.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.17.23"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
